QuestGuidance.Register("en",14,{
[417]="70049565\n1\tTalk to Gimli in Lûghash\tGimli can be found on the central level of Lûghash. King Váskmun Greytooth desires to hear Gimli's tales of valour. You should join Gimli in recounting your adventures in Middle-earth.\n2\tTalk to Spakorth on the plains of Dor Amarth outside Lûghash\tSpakorth can be found along the causeway outside Lûghash. You have been cast out of Lûghash by King Greytooth and the Firehorns. You should speak to Spakorth.\n",
[418]="70040421\n1\tDestroy barrels of rotting food (total: 8)\tBarrels of rotting food can be found in an abandoned home in Lothgobel. You should destroy the barrels of rotting food, for the abandoned house is being defiled by the stink of the hounds.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have dealt with the rotting meat left in this poor Gondorian's abandoned home.\n",
[419]="7002ED21\n1\tAssist Offram with A City Under Siege\030Assist Goldwine with Preparing for the Siege\030Assist Botulf with Reassuring Words\030Assist Pedwin with Courage from a Keg\tGuards may be found throughout Eaworth. Adalmód has asked you to help the guards of Eaworth prepare for the coming siege.\n2\tTalk to Adalmód at the Mead Hall of Eaworth\tAdalmód stands guard at the entrance to the Mead Hall of Eaworth. You should return to Adalmód now that you have done as he asked.\n",
[420]="700097DC\n1\tFind Nat Rapkins\tNat Rapkins crossed the Even-rills at the northern tip of the lake, north-west of Ost Forod, and never returned. Robin Dunkley wants you to search along the edge of the lake near the Even-rills for the missing hunter. Robin Dunkley heard a dreadful howling along the shore at night and is worried that Nat Rapkins might have fallen to some evil beast. He wants you to try and find the lost hunter.\n2\tBring Nat Rapkins' pack to Robin Dunkley\tRobin Dunkley is in Ost Forod, south-east of the Even-rills, in Tyrn Fornech in Evendim. Nat Rapkins spoke of the Gauredain with his dying breath and gave you his pack to return to Ost Forod. You should bring it to Robin Dunkley.\n",
[421]="7001A4A5\n1\tDefeat Taughâsh Wargs in Maudhul-ulur (total: 10)\tWargs can be found at Maudhul-ulur, south from Echad Glamodúd. Goldínwen has asked you to defeat many Wargs at the kennel nearby.\n2\tTalk to Goldínwen at Echad Glamodúd\tGoldínwen is at Echad Glamodúd, north from Maudhul-ulur. You should return to Goldínwen with the news that you have defeated many Wargs at Maudhul-ulur.\n",
[422]="70062D6F\n1\tTaste the roast avanc\tCulhuc is in Lhan Garan, near the oven along the water-front path. Sample the roast next to Culhuc in Lhan Garan.\n2\tTalk to Culhuc\tCulhuc is waiting to hear your thoughts about his dish. Talk to Culhuc in Lhan Garan.\n",
[423]="70052B1B\n1\tSalvage sealed provisions from Fil Sulmog (total: 6)\tSealed provisions can be found at Fil Sulmog. Hárskor has asked you to salvage any sealed provisions you can find at Fil Sulmog.\n2\tDurbkhat can be found in the depths of the cave at Fil Sulmog. Determined to avenge the hurts done to the Beornings and Woodmen, Hárskor has asked you to find and defeat Durbkhat, a large Orc leading the Shapag-hai in Woodsedge.\t\n3\tTalk to Hárskor at Hadhodiant\tHárskor can be found in the eastern ruins of Hadhodiant. You have driven Durbkhat from Fil Sulmog and salvaged a great deal of provisions. You should return to Hadhodiant and deliver the provisions to Hárskor.\n4\tDeliver the sealed provisions to Ríkmar in Hultvís\tRíkmar can be found in Hultvís. Hárskor has returned to the Beorning-lands to prepare a new shipment of provisions for Hultvís. You should deliver the provisions you salvaged from Fil Sulmog to Ríkmar and assure him that the Beornings will deliver more provisions in the coming days.\n",
[424]="70058BB9\n1\tDestroy Orkish provisions at Bagûd-mekhem (total: 20)\tOrkish provisions can be found at Bagûd-mekhem. It appears that Gorgar has ordered that provisions be brought to Bagûd-mekhem in an attempt to draw out the War of Three Peaks. You should destroy Orkish provisions at Bagûd-mekhem.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have destroyed many Orkish provisions at Bagûd-mekhem.\n",
[425]="7002FD77\n1\tFind food for Langar's cat\tThe food can likely be found near the Mead Hall of Garsfeld. Langar has asked that you find food for his cat in Garsfeld. However, he worries that the guards will not take kindly to giving rations to a pet.\n2\tDeliver food to Langar's cat and avoid Garsfeld guards\tRations can be found outside the mead-hall. Langar wants you to sneak a ration for his beloved pet without being caught. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n3\tTalk to Langar\tLangar can be found in west Garsfeld. You should speak with Langar about the task he set for you.\n",
[426]="70028B3B\n1\tDefeat elder wolves in the Fanged Lair (total: 10)\tElder wolves can be found in the Fanged Lair, north of Galtrev. You should defeat many elder wolves in Pren Gwydh.\n2\tTalk to Hopcun in Galtrev\tHopcun can be found in Galtrev, awaiting your safe return. You should speak with Hopcun and inform him that the hunt was successful.\n",
[427]="70028B3A\n1\tDefeat common wolves (total: 10)\tCommon wolves can be found roaming boldly throughout Pren Gwydh. Since the warriors have left, the people of Galtrev must rely on you to hunt the wolves of this land.\n2\tTalk to Hopcun in Galtrev\tHopcun is in Galtrev. You should return to Hopcun after your successful hunt.\n",
[428]="7000006F\n1\tTalk to Gytha Lainey\tGytha Lainey is at Adso's Camp in Bree-land, on the road between Buckland and the town of Bree. Gytha Lainey has sent word to you that she urgently needs your help.\n2\tTalk to Gytha Lainey and travel into the Shire\tGytha Lainey is at Adso's Camp in Breeland, on the road between Bree-town and Buckland. Gytha Lainey is waiting to speak with you and then travel into the Shire to intercept the hunting-party of Wargs that have come south in search of one of their own.\n3\tTalk to Gytha Lainey\tGytha Lainey is at Adso's Camp in Breeland, on the road between Bree-town and Buckland. Gytha Lainey is waiting to speak with you about your defence of the town of Overhill.\n",
[429]="70071CCD\n1\tDefeat jázgai in Dân Shatagan (total: 12)\tDefeat jázgai near Dân Shatagan. Dân Shatagan can be found north of Ingar-garâsh.\n2\tReturn to Razâl in Ingar-garâsh\tReturn to Razâl in Ingar-garâsh with news of your success.\n",
[430]="70041364\n1\tSpeak to Herion\tHerion can be found in his encampment in western Dor-en-Ernil. Herion asks you to travel with him back to Linhir.\n2\tSpeak with Erchar\tErchar can be found in the town of Linhir. You have finished your journey from western Dor-en-Ernil to Linhir, and should now speak with Erchar.\n",
[431]="70046C43\n1\tComplete A Just Reward - Honour Alone\030Complete A Just Reward - Spoils of War\tJarl Gurthilm can be found to the south-east of Aragorn's camp on the border of Dagorlad. Jarl Gurthilm has offered you payment for the aid you gave to him and his men. You should discuss your choice with him.\n2\tTalk to Jarl Gurthilm\tJarl Gurthilm can be found to the south-east of Aragorn's camp on the border of Dagorlad. You have made your choice and should now speak to Jarl Gurthilm before parting ways.\n",
[432]="70046C3F\n1\tTalk to Drúgred\tDrúgred can be found to the south-east of Aragorn's camp on the border of Dagorlad. You have chosen to forgo your share of the gold, but Drúgred will offer you a meagre amount of supplies in return.\n",
[433]="70046C41\n1\tTalk to Blothára\tBlothára can be found to the south-east of Aragorn's camp on the border of Dagorlad. You have chosen to accept your share of the gold, and Blothára can deliver it to you when you are prepared.\n",
[434]="7005C8B2\n1\tFind the horn used by the Dourhands to summon the Iron Crown key-warden\tThe Dourhands' summoning horn can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. Múta has asked you to seek out the Dourhands' summoning horn at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate and summon an Iron Crown key-warden. You should find the summoning horn at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate.\n2\tUse the Dourhands' summoning horn and confront the Iron Crown key-warden\tThe Dourhands' summoning horn can be found along the road at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. You have discovered the Dourhands' summoning horn and you should now sound it in an attempt to summon the Iron Crown key-warden.\n3\tTalk to Múta at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate\tMúta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. You have collected a single, small key from the Iron Crown key-warden. You should return to Múta.\n4\tFree Múta from her cage at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate\tMúta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. You have collected a single, small key from the Iron Crown key-warden. You should use it to attempt to free Múta from her cage.\n5\tTalk to Múta at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate\tMúta can be found at Mur Shatraug, the Witch-gate. You have managed to unlock Múta's cage. You should talk to Múta.\n",
[435]="70030AE7\n1\tEnter the Silkenhold\tAcorns can be found on the floor of the Silkenhold in northern Fangorn. You should collect acorns to rescue them from a certain unpleasant fate.\n2\tRescue acorns (total: 10)\tAcorns can be found on the floor of the Silkenhold in northern Fangorn. You should collect acorns to rescue them from a certain unpleasant fate.\n3\tShow the acorns to the Huorn\tThe distressed Huorn is at the southern stair leading up to the Silkenhood in northern Fangorn. You should show the acorns you rescued to the Huorn.\n4\tScatter the acorns near a sunbeam\tThe nearest sunbeam is south-west from the Huorn at the foot of the stairs of the Silkenhold. You should scatter the acorns to the earth near the beam of light that shines from a clearing in the forest's roof.\n5\tReturn to the Huorn\tThe Huorn is at the foot of the stair leading to the Silkenhold in northern Fangorn. You should return to the Huorn.\n6\tSearch for another Ent in Fangorn\tYour exploration of Fangorn should continue in the north-west reaches of the forest. You should search for another Ent to the west of the Silkenhold.\n",
[436]="7004DA66\n1\tHear King Thorin III's judgment\tKing Thorin III can be found at his throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. Gimli has offered an impassioned plea for the Stout-axes to be accepted as friends and kin to Durin's Folk. You should hear King Thorin's judgment on the matter.\n2\tTalk to Gimli\tGimli can be found near King Thorin's throne in the Hall Under the Mountain. King Thorin III has passed his judgment on what is to be done regarding the Stout-axes. You should now speak to Gimli.\n",
[437]="70059A6B\n1\tTalk to King Elessar\tKing Elessar can be found in the Hall of the King. Arvedui has asked you to talk to King Elessar on his behalf.\n",
[438]="70015E08\n1\tBring the axe to Inufileg in Gwingris\tGwingris is at the northern end of Glâd Ereg. You should bring the axe to the Elves in Gwingris.\n",
[439]="7002CB0F\n1\tSearch the spider-cocoons in search of the strange creature (total: 8)\tCocoons of spider-webbing may be found to the west of the hidden clearing, among the northern hills. Landroval has asked you to search among the spider-cocoons for any sign of the creature he was tasked with following.\n2\tTalk to Landroval about what you have found\tLandroval can be found at the clearing of trees in the north-east section of Wailing Hills. Landroval must be informed of the results of your search for the sneaking creature.\n",
[440]="7003A3A6\n1\tCollect hides (total: 12)\030Collect bear-claws (total: 3)\030Collect goat-hooves (total: 3)\030Collect venison (total: 3)\tWild beasts roam the lands around Woodhurst. Guard-captain Thurferth asked that you collect hides, bear-claws, goat-hooves, and venison to supply the garrison.\n2\tTalk to Guard-captain Thurferth\tReturn the supplies to Thurferth, near the centre of Woodhurst. Guard Captain Thurferth will be thankful for these supplies.\n3\tTalk to Herubrand\tHerubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse. You should bring the ill news of the mismanagement of the city's monies, as it may help explain why the situation in Woodhurst is growing worse.\n4\tTalk to Elda\tElda has not been seen since the council-meeting, but he should be somewhere in Woodhurst. You need to speak with Elda about the funding for the guards that has not been delivered.\n5\tTalk to Herubrand\tHerubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse. Herubrand should know what Elda had to say about the funds for the city guards.\n6\tTalk to Guard-captain Thurferth\tGuard-captain Thurferth is near the centre of the city. You should return to Guard-captain Thurferth and inform him of the misplacement of funding that was intended for him.\n",
[441]="7002EE1E\n1\tTalk to Adalmód outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth\tAdalmód stands guard outside the Mead Hall of Eaworth. You should speak with Adalmód to gain access to the Mead Hall of Eaworth.\n",
[442]="70031B6A\n1\tTalk to Lady Góda\tLady Góda is in her cell within the prison of Eaworth. You should learn what Lady Góda wishes to say.\n",
[443]="70049555\n1\tScout the causeway to ruins of Barad-dûr\tThe causeway extends to the south-east from the Isenmouthe, eventually leading to the foot of Barad-dûr. Legolas has asked you to scout the causeway leading to the ruins of Barad-dûr as he desires to learn what foes still lurk in the shadows of its toppled heights.\n2\tExamine the fallen dwarf\030Examine the fallen dwarf's goat\030Collect the fallen dwarf's shield\tThe fallen dwarf and his goat can be found to the north of the causeway to Barad-dûr. You have found a fallen dwarf and his goat. You should examine them and collect his shield.\n3\tDeliver the dwarf-shield to Gimli at the Ruins of Díngarth\tGimli can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth due south of the Isenmouthe in Dor Amarth. You have found evidence of dwarves in Mordor and collected one of their shields. You should bring the shield to Gimli and see what he makes of it.\n",
[444]="7003FC4F\n1\tGather Lord Duinhir's notes\tLord Duinhir's notes can be found inside Malthellam's home in Morlad. Malthellam hopes to repair his friendship with Lady Rosfin, and has asked you to return her husband's notes to her.\n2\tBring Lord Duinhir's notes to Lady Rosfin\tLady Rosfin can be found atop Morlad outside her home. You have gathered Lord Duinhir's notes and should now return them to Lady Rosfin.\n3\tTalk to Malthellam\tMalthellam can be found outside his house near the entrance to Morlad. You have delivered Lord Duinhir's notes and spoke to Lady Rosfin about providing counsel for the good of the vale, and should now return to Malthellam.\n4\tTalk to Lady Rosfin outside Malthellam's home\tLady Rosfin can be found outside Malthellam's home in Morlad. Lady Rosfin has honoured Malthellam's request and has arrived to serve as his counselor. You should now speak to her.\n",
[445]="70062B16\n1\tTalk to Eleri about the mark of the White Hand\tEleri stands over the dead bodies of the Uruk raiders, considering the events of the attack.\n2\tTalk to Meneldir\tMeneldir wears a worried expression.\n",
[446]="70062B1D\n1\tTalk to Eleri about the mark of the White Hand\tEleri stands over the dead bodies of the Uruk raiders, considering the events of the attack.\n2\tTalk to Meneldir\tMeneldir wears a worried expression.\n",
[447]="70062B1F\n1\tTalk to Eleri about the mark of the White Hand\tEleri stands over the dead bodies of the Uruk raiders, considering the events of the attack.\n2\tTalk to Meneldir\tMeneldir wears a worried expression.\n",
[448]="70062B20\n1\tTalk to Eleri about the mark of the White Hand\tEleri stands over the dead bodies of the Uruk raiders, considering the events of the attack.\n2\tTalk to Meneldir\tMeneldir wears a worried expression.\n",
